(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the command sequence and prompt interactions in AutoCAD to model a 3D flanged coupling hub: a 120 mm base flange of 25 mm thickness, a 60 mm central hub of 40 mm height, and a 30 mm bore.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   AutoCAD 3D Modeling Command Sequence:) Tj
T*
(   1. Initialize 3D Environment:) Tj
T*
(   - Command: VIEW -> Select 'SW Isometric' view.) Tj
T*
(   - Command: VISUALSTYLES -> Select 'Shaded with Edges'.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Model Base Flange \(Diameter 120 mm x Thickness 25 mm\):) Tj
T*
(   - Command: CYLINDER [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Specify center point of base: 0,0,0 [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Specify base radius or [Diameter]: D [Enter] -> 120 [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Specify height: 25 [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Result: Solid cylinder 'Flange' created from Z = 0 to Z = 25 mm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Model Central Hub \(Diameter 60 mm x Height 40 mm\):) Tj
T*
(   - Command: CYLINDER [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Specify center point of base: 0,0,25 [Enter] \(Snaps to top center of base flange\).) Tj
T*
(   - Specify base diameter: D [Enter] -> 60 [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Specify height: 40 [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Result: Solid cylinder 'Hub' created from Z = 25 to Z = 65 mm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Union Flange and Hub into a Single Monolithic Solid:) Tj
T*
(   - Command: UNION [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Select objects: Click Flange -> Click Hub -> [Enter].) Tj
T*
(   - Result: Both primitives fuse into a single solid component.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Model Through-Bore Hole \(Diameter 30 mm through entire 65 mm height\):) Tj
T*
(   - Command: CYLINDER [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Specify center point of base: 0,0,0 [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Specify diameter: D [Enter] -> 30 [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - Specify height: 70 [Enter] \(Slightly taller than total height to ensure clean cut\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   6. Subtract Bore Cylinder from Parent Solid:) Tj
T*
(   - Command: SUBTRACT [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   - 'Select objects to subtract from \(base\)': Click the unified Flange-Hub solid -> [Enter].) Tj
T*
(   - 'Select objects to subtract \(tool\)': Click the 30 mm bore cylinder -> [Enter].) Tj
T*
(   - Result: A finished, publication-grade 3D solid flanged coupling hub with central bore!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
