(   Step-by-Step Construction Procedure \(True Scale 1:1\):) Tj
T*
(   1. Construct the Base Cylindrical Slab \(100 mm dia x 25 mm thick\):) Tj
T*
(   - Step 1: Draw isometric axes \(30?, 90?, 150?\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 2: Establish the center O of the bottom base on the ground plane \(Z = 0\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 3: Draw an isometric rhombus of side 100 mm on Isoplane Top centered at O. Using the) Tj
T*
