T*
(   - Step 8: The base of the cone rests centrally on the top face of the cylindrical slab \(center) Tj
T*
(   O'\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 9: About center O', construct an isometric rhombus of side 60 mm on Isoplane Top.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 10: Using the Four-Center Method, draw the isometric ellipse representing the 60 mm base) Tj
T*
(   of the cone. \(Note: Only the front curve is visible; the rear is hidden by the cone body\).) Tj
T*
(   - Step 11: From center O', erect a vertical centerline of height 75 mm to locate the cone apex) Tj
T*
(   V \(Total height Z = 25 + 75 = 100 mm\).) Tj
T*
