T*
(   the 60 mm base ellipse.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Final Linework Finishing:) Tj
T*
(   - Darken the visible tangent cone lines, the visible front curve of the cone base, the exposed) Tj
T*
(   annular top face of the cylinder, the vertical cylinder boundary lines, and the lower front) Tj
T*
(   curve of the cylinder.) Tj
T*
(   - Erase all construction rhombuses and centerlines.) Tj
