(   [Problem Statement]: A hollow square prism \(outside 60 mm x 60 mm, inside square hole 30 mm x 30 mm, height 80 mm\) has its axis vertical. Describe the detailed drafting steps to draw its Isometric View.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step-by-Step Drafting Procedure \(True Scale 1:1\):) Tj
T*
(   1. Construct the Outer Base Rhombus \(Z = 0\):) Tj
T*
(   - Draw isometric axes \(30? right, 150? left, 90? vertical\).) Tj
T*
(   - From origin O, measure 60 mm along 30? axis \(point A\) and 60 mm along 150? axis \(point B\).) Tj
T*
(   - Complete the bottom outer rhombus O-A-C-B of side 60 mm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Construct the Outer Top Rhombus \(at Height 80 mm\):) Tj
T*
(   - From vertices O, A, C, and B, erect vertical lines of height 80 mm to points O', A', C', and) Tj
T*
(   B'.) Tj
T*
(   - Connect O'-A'-C'-B' to form the top outer horizontal face of the prism.) Tj
T*
(   - Darken the three visible vertical corner edges \(A-A', O-O', B-B'\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Construct the Central Square Hole on the Top Face:) Tj
T*
(   - On top face O'-A'-C'-B', find center P by intersecting diagonals A'-B' and O'-C'.) Tj
T*
(   - About center P, construct an internal isometric rhombus of side 30 mm \(edges parallel to) Tj
T*
(   outer prism edges, spaced 15 mm on either side of center P\).) Tj
T*
(   - This 30 mm rhombus represents the top opening of the square hole. All four edges are 100%) Tj
T*
(   visible.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Draw the Visible Interior Vertical Corner of the Hole:) Tj
T*
(   - From the front-inside corner Q of the 30 mm hole rhombus, draw a vertical line downward into) Tj
T*
(   the hole.) Tj
T*
(   - The line extends downward by the full height 80 mm \(or until it intersects the visible floor) Tj
T*
(   of the hole\).) Tj
T*
(   - Since the hole is 80 mm deep and 30 mm wide, the bottom floor is obscured, but the vertical) Tj
T*
(   internal corner edge is visible, conveying dramatic internal hollow depth!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Finishing:) Tj
T*
(   - Darken outer boundaries and internal hole outlines. Erase construction lines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
