(   [Problem Statement]: Summarize the complete quality assurance audit protocol for validating 3D solid models and isometric drawings prior to manufacturing production.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Engineering Quality Audit Protocol for 3D Modeling & Isometric Drawings:) Tj
T*
(   1. 3D Solid Geometry Integrity Check:) Tj
T*
(   - Verify that all solid primitives are watertight and manifold \(run MASSPROP to verify positive) Tj
T*
(   volume\).) Tj
T*
(   - Run INTERFERE across all assembly components to confirm zero unintended clashes or material) Tj
T*
(   overlaps.) Tj
T*
(   - Ensure all cylindrical holes penetrate completely through walls without paper-thin leftover) Tj
T*
(   membranes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Isometric View Accuracy \(2D Drawings\):) Tj
T*
(   - Confirm all isometric axes are aligned strictly at 120? \(30?, 90?, 150?\).) Tj
T*
(   - Verify that true scale \(1:1\) is applied consistently across all three axes in Isometric) Tj
T*
(   Views, or reduced scale \(0.8165\) in Isometric Projections.) Tj
T*
(   - Check that non-isometric lines were plotted via coordinates \(Box Method\), not measured) Tj
T*
(   directly.) Tj
T*
(   - Verify that all circles on isometric planes were constructed as true isocircles \(Four-Center) Tj
T*
(   Method or ELLIPSE Isocircle\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Sphere Representation Compliance:) Tj
T*
(   - Verify that spheres are drawn as TRUE CIRCLES with center offset by correct vertical height.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Isometric Dimensioning Standards:) Tj
T*
(   - Confirm dimension lines are parallel to isometric axes and extension lines project along) Tj
T*
(   adjacent axes.) Tj
T*
(   - Verify that text annotations are aligned with isoplanes using appropriate obliquing angles) Tj
T*
(   \(?30?\).) Tj
T*
